      "writtenOn": "2015-02-23T20:34:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "why are we registering them now? is there a reason we don\u0027t just add them to:\n\nhttps://github.com/openstack/keystone/blob/master/keystone/common/config.py#L859\n\nand \n\nwe could make a new group and option for \u0027oidc\u0027.",
